  {
   "title": "Objectif",
   "html": "<p>Dire ce que tu aimes, ce que tu n&#x27;aimes pas, et nuancer (beaucoup, pas trop, vraiment).</p>"
  },
  {
   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Noy et Clara parlent de nourriture.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເຈົ້າມັກອາຫານລາວບໍ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Jâo māk ǎa-hǎan láaw bɔ̌ɔ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ມັກຫຼາຍ! ໂດຍສະເພາະລາບ</span><span class=\"rom\">Māk lǎay! Dóoy-sā-phɔ̄ lâap.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ມັກປາແດກບໍ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Māk pǎa-dɛ̏ɛk bɔ̌ɔ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ບໍ່ມັກປານໃດ ມັນເຄັມໂພດ</span><span class=\"rom\">Bɔ̀ɔ māk pǎan-dǎy. Mán khém phôot.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂ້ອຍມັກແທ້!</span><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̂ɔy māk thɛ̏ɛ!</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Noy</b> — Tu aimes la cuisine lao ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Beaucoup ! Surtout le larb.<br><b>Noy</b> — Tu aimes le padèk ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Pas trop. C&#x27;est trop salé.<br><b>Noy</b> — Moi, j&#x27;adore !</p></details>"
  },
